WEBVTT

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.467
Are you a SMART fella...

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:04.533
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:06.800
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.733 --> 00:00:10.733
Question thirteen, a picture puzzle!

00:00:10.733 --> 00:00:13.000
A dot marches clockwise around

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.867
a square: top-left,

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:17.100
top-right, bottom-right... where

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.767
does it jump next?

00:00:18.867 --> 00:00:21.200
A, top-left... B,

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:24.133
bottom-left... C, top-right...

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.967
or D, the center?

00:00:25.967 --> 00:00:27.733
Five seconds!

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:35.800
TIME'S UP! Pencils down!

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:37.467
The answer is...

00:00:37.467 --> 00:00:41.000
B, bottom-left! The dot steps clockwise,

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.067
corner to corner,

00:00:42.067 --> 00:00:43.733
and right after bottom-right,

00:00:43.733 --> 00:00:46.133
the next corner is bottom-left!

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:50.000
So, are you smart or fart?

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:51.767
Count up your correct answers to

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.400
find your rank!

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:55.833
So, how did you do?

00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:57.267
Comment your score below,

00:00:57.267 --> 00:00:58.933
and follow for more!
